config RDD2_STEP_TIMING
	bool "Measure the periodic control path with the DWT cycle counter"
	depends on CPU_CORTEX_M
	default n
	help
	  Bracket the generated control steps with the Cortex-M7 DWT cycle
	  counter and log a worst case, mean, and coarse histogram at a low
	  rate. Intended for bench work on real silicon: it is the only way to
	  observe external-flash wait states and cache behaviour, which the
	  rehosted FastDyn image cannot model. Numbers produced under FastDyn
	  are QEMU artefacts and are labelled as such. Off by default so flight
	  images carry no instrumentation.
